WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Welcome to Lee's Detective Agency.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
We accept every manner of requests

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000
and will do our best to meet your needs

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
in goods delivery, pickup,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.041
infiltration, investigation,

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.500
arbitration, and conflict resolution.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.750
We can solve *anything* in Lungmen.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.500
And certainly,

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.666
except for detective work

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:19.125
because that's police business...

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:22.000
Please don't expect this to be a detective show.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.916
Illuminating street lamps.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.750
Lit up the city.

00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:00.791
Criss-crossing neons,

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.875
and I begin to see.

00:01:06.416 --> 00:01:10.625
The day just ended for someone.

00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:16.541
And the day just started for somebody.

00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:21.666
In empty streets I walked about

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:26.791
Confessing my boredom out loud.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.750
I wanna keep feeling it

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:33.375
But you won't forget about this

00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:38.166
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:40.375
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:44.375
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.750
When a future

00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:50.125
You just waved to me.

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:06.083
A Cup of Tequila

00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:22.500
This is a sculpture of a beaker.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.500
A beaker is already a sculpture.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.125
Why would you make a sculpture of a sculpture?

00:02:28.666 --> 00:02:30.750
Well, you can place it next to your work bench.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.916
Make things look artsy.

00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:38.916
What do you think?

00:02:38.916 --> 00:02:40.625
This gift's from me.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.500
This is a toy for kids.

00:02:45.166 --> 00:02:46.500
That's actually lots of fun.

00:02:53.416 --> 00:02:56.875
I'm an adult. Can you at least give me something new?

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.041
We did give you different presents this year.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.125
This is so boring.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:09.791
Where are you going?

00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:12.291
We... we received a request.

00:03:12.875 --> 00:03:13.875
Can I go?

00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:17.125
No. The place is for adults only.

00:03:18.416 --> 00:03:20.125
I'm an adult today!

00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:32.875
Let's start decorating.

00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:41.125
Since you're an adult...

00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:43.166
...if I can't make it out on my own, you'll carry me back to the agency office.

00:03:44.375 --> 00:03:45.375
Roger that.

00:04:12.041 --> 00:04:13.625
This isn't for you.

00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:14.916
You'll just get milk.

00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:16.375
Lee...

00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:18.541
...when did you start letting kids tag along?

00:04:19.375 --> 00:04:20.166
I'M NOT A...

00:04:20.166 --> 00:04:23.250
Adults are talking. Play somewhere else, boy.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:24.875
WHAT?!

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:30.291
I'll go look around.

00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:35.625
I thought you'd come alone today, Lee.

00:04:36.791 --> 00:04:39.000
Lee's Detective Agency might be able to help you out...

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.500
...but you did promise me intel about the Cat Mafia.

00:04:46.375 --> 00:04:47.291
Intel?

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.666
We can hardly save our own skins right now.

00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:56.250
We can handle that sum of money for you...

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.041
...that's open to discussion.

00:04:58.041 --> 00:04:59.791
But don't push your luck.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:13.500
The Cat Mafia is growing bolder by the day.

00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:18.500
I don't even know where these strays come from.

00:05:22.791 --> 00:05:26.125
I haven't even heard about them until recently.

00:05:27.375 --> 00:05:28.625
Well...

00:05:36.375 --> 00:05:39.791
...the Cat Mafia was around during the Rat King's time...

00:05:40.166 --> 00:05:42.375
...but that was a while ago. And then they suddenly vanished.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:43.500
This new Cat Mafia...

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.791
...are busy with some secret pharmaceutical trade.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.250
They're into other shady businesses as well.

00:05:51.041 --> 00:05:53.166
This Cat Mafia is nothing like the one we knew.

00:06:04.791 --> 00:06:06.500
You're back, boy.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.375
I'm not a boy.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.541
Well then, can you drink?

00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:18.500
HAH, I KNEW IT! You're just a boy.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.500
Happy birthday!

00:08:03.375 --> 00:08:07.666
I'll teach that brat a real lesson next time.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.000
Next time, don't push yourself so hard.

00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:23.625
It's his birthday. The boy thought he grew up.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:35.416
Drinking and business should be kept far away from each other.

00:08:58.791 --> 00:08:59.541
You have a hangover.

00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:01.375
My head hurts.

00:09:03.375 --> 00:09:04.500
Happy birthday!

00:09:10.625 --> 00:09:12.375
Did I forget something?

00:09:55.416 --> 00:09:56.875
Lee's D.A has been charged with the safekeeping

00:09:56.875 --> 00:09:58.791
of a secret gold card for Mr. Meng the banker. 

00:09:58.791 --> 00:10:00.583
In return, Mr. Meng shall provide intel 

00:10:00.583 --> 00:10:02.333
about the Cat Mafia to Lee's D.A. 

00:10:02.333 --> 00:10:04.500
Both parties shall abide by the principles of voluntarism,

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.083
partnership, and good faith, 

00:10:06.083 --> 00:10:07.916
and observe strict confidentiality over this matter.

00:10:07.916 --> 00:10:08.750
Ignore the useless nonsense. 

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.416
Now for the important stuff: HAPPY BIRTHDAY, AAK!

00:10:12.416 --> 00:10:15.416
To be continued...

